# Goal
string description
sensor_msgs/CompressedImage[] images
---
# Result
string message
# Ordered ground waypoints to follow, normalized image space (point.x, point.y in
# [-1, 1], center = 0; z unused), nearest-first. May be empty.
geometry_msgs/Point[] waypoints
# Signed in-place rotation to apply after following the path (degrees), measured from
# the heading the robot ends the path with. + = left (CCW), - = right (CW), 0 = none.
float64 turn_degrees
# Stamp of the current-view frame the path was planned on.
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
---
# Feedback
string state
